sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant FE as React Next.js Frontend
    participant BE as FastAPI Backend
    participant Agent as Kubi Agent API
    participant K8s as K8s API Server

    User->>FE: Inputs: "kubectl get pods -n demo"
    
    rect rgb(30, 30, 30)
    FE->>BE: POST /api/execute
    Note right of FE: Headers: { x-cluster-id: "prod-cluster-1" }<br/>Body: { "cmd": "kubectl get pods -n demo" }
    end

    BE->>BE: Validate x-cluster-id & Route
    
    rect rgb(30, 30, 30)
    BE->>Agent: Forward POST to Port 8080
    Note right of BE: Body: { "cmd": "kubectl get pods -n demo" }
    end

    Agent->>Agent: Parse string OR execute via subprocess
    
    rect rgb(30, 30, 30)
    Agent->>K8s: K8s API Call
    Note right of Agent: e.g., GET /api/v1/namespaces/demo/pods
    end
    
    K8s-->>Agent: 200 OK (Pod Data JSON)
    Agent-->>BE: Formatted Text or JSON Output
    BE-->>FE: HTTP 200 Response
    FE-->>User: Renders result on screen